{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"additional_concerns\":[\"The formula treats the stated automatic threshold as requiring an established measurement fact, but the circular supplies no method for calculating or evidencing a particular Fund's aggregate direct and indirect exposure.\",\"The formula correctly retains actual SFC designation as a separate route; the listed designation factors do not themselves establish designation.\",\"The source's reference to external sale requirements, the UT Code, and the LAF circular does not supply those authorities' operative contents.\"],\"checks\":[{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"No additional external authority is needed to establish the circular's disclosure statement.\",\"status\":\"NONE_DECLARED\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.68f8e39cf8e43c95a1e0890d\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.79cbf0697ede834797a7e5ed\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"The representation contains no disclosure-requirement rule because that obligation does not determine the requested classification result.\",\"representation_quotes\":[],\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE\"},\"followup_questions\":[],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Funds with direct or indirect exposure to private market assets are required to observe the enhanced disclosure requirements set out in this circular.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u4.564\"}],\"question_hash\":\"4f10da87ddb322d03b098a5b1c69788f047e6978f5ae63ea518a5ed15a2de392\",\"rationale\":\"This is a separate exposure-triggered disclosure duty, not a condition for complex-product treatment.\",\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE_TO_THIS_QUESTION\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Funds with direct or indirect exposure to private market assets are required to observe the enhanced disclosure requirements set out in this circular.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u4.564\"}],\"rationale\":\"The quoted circular text directly supports the stated duty.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}},{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The retained circular itself establishes the exclusion; the separate LAF circular is unnecessary to establish that exclusion, though necessary to assess LAFs under its own regime.\",\"status\":\"NONE_DECLARED\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.68f8e39cf8e43c95a1e0890d\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.7b15c56c0ca00a9b9ee58838\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"The formula expressly excludes a Fund for which the LAF classification fact is true, while retaining UNKNOWN where the classification is unresolved.\",\"representation_quotes\":[\"Scope: all of these conditions hold: [the fact sfc_authorised_public_fund; it is not the case that [the fact listed_closed_ended_alternative_asset_fund]]\",\"Runtime semantics: Missing or temporally unavailable facts evaluate as UNKNOWN.\"] ,\"status\":\"PRESERVES\"},\"followup_questions\":[\"To determine the applicable regime for a particular LAF, supply the separate LAF circular or an identifiable dependency for it.\"],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Except for listed closed-ended alternative asset funds (LAFs). For LAFs, please refer to the circular on LAFs:\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u63.8691\"}],\"question_hash\":\"4f10da87ddb322d03b098a5b1c69788f047e6978f5ae63ea518a5ed15a2de392\",\"rationale\":\"The question expressly asks to distinguish exclusions, and the candidate's assessment unit excludes LAFs.\",\"status\":\"RELEVANT\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Except for listed closed-ended alternative asset funds (LAFs). For LAFs, please refer to the circular on LAFs:\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u63.8691\"}],\"rationale\":\"The footnote directly supports exclusion from this circular and referral to another circular; it does not say LAFs are non-complex.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}},{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"No additional authority is needed for the circular's below-threshold discretionary-designation statement.\",\"status\":\"NONE_DECLARED\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.68f8e39cf8e43c95a1e0890d\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.7bb4e011e39ca280c11cbcf5\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"The representation preserves the separate actual-designation route and does not infer a negative designation from exposure below 50%.\",\"representation_quotes\":[\"Result: at least one of these conditions holds: [the fact aggregate_private_market_exposure_at_least_half_nav; the fact applicable_sfc_complex_product_designation]\",\"applicable_sfc_complex_product_designation: Whether an actual SFC case-by-case designation of the particular Fund as a complex product applies at the assessment time. Mere risk factors, possible designation or an unsearched designation history do not establish a positive or negative value.\"] ,\"status\":\"PRESERVES\"},\"followup_questions\":[],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"In assessing whether the complex product designation is warranted7, the SFC will adopt a holistic approach taking into account the specific circumstances of the case.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u29.4630\"},{\"quote\":\"7 In cases where the Fund’s aggregate direct and indirect exposures to private market assets are less than 50% of the Fund’s NAV.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u64.8910\"}],\"question_hash\":\"4f10da87ddb322d03b098a5b1c69788f047e6978f5ae63ea518a5ed15a2de392\",\"rationale\":\"This establishes that below-threshold exposure does not rule out the designation route central to the question.\",\"status\":\"RELEVANT\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"In assessing whether the complex product designation is warranted7, the SFC will adopt a holistic approach taking into account the specific circumstances of the case.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u29.4630\"},{\"quote\":\"7 In cases where the Fund’s aggregate direct and indirect exposures to private market assets are less than 50% of the Fund’s NAV.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852ce